info.description:
Collection for testing the WebSocket streaming API.

**NOTE**: If this request opens as an HTTP request in Postman, please:
1. Click 'New' > 'WebSocket Request'
2. Paste URL: `ws://localhost:8000/ws/canva_request`
3. Paste the Message body below.

**Message Payload:**
```json
{
  "card": {
    "title": "Introduction to AI",
    "description": "Overview of artificial intelligence..."
  },
  "page_dimensions": {
    "dimensions": {
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 1080
    }
  }
}
```
